      "source": "Creates a default <a href=\"ValueExpressionDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ValueExpressionDelegate</code></a> using the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/StandardEnvironment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>StandardEnvironment</code></a>, a default <a href=\"../../expression/ValueExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\"><code>ValueExpression</code></a> and extension-less\n<a href=\"../../spel/EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/StandardEnvironment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>StandardEnvironment</code></a> 创建一个默认的 <a href=\"ValueExpressionDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ValueExpressionDelegate</code></a>，一个默认的 <a href=\"../../expression/ValueExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\"><code>ValueExpression</code></a> 以及不带扩展的 <a href=\"../../spel/EvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>EvaluationContextProvider</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ValueExpressionDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ValueExpressionDelegate</code></a> given <a href=\"QueryMethodValueEvaluationContextAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryMethodValueEvaluationContextAccessor</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../../expression/ValueExpressionParser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\"><code>ValueExpressionParser</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a href=\"QueryMethodValueEvaluationContextAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>QueryMethodValueEvaluationContextAccessor</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../../expression/ValueExpressionParser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\"><code>ValueExpressionParser</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"ValueExpressionDelegate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ValueExpressionDelegate</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
