      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"../../expression/ValueEvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\"><code>ValueEvaluationContextProvider</code></a> for query method <a href=\"Parameters.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Parameters</code></a> for later creation of a\n<a href=\"../../expression/ValueEvaluationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\"><code>ValueEvaluationContext</code></a> based on the actual method parameter values. The resulting\n<a href=\"../../expression/ValueEvaluationContextProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\"><code>ValueEvaluationContextProvider</code></a> is only valid for the given parameters",
