      "source": "<dt>Specified by:</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueExpressionParser.html#parse(java.lang.String)\">parse</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueExpressionParser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\">ValueExpressionParser</a></code></dd>\n<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>expressionString</code> - the raw expression string to parse.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>an evaluator for the parsed expression.</dd>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/ParseException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\">ParseException</a></code> - an exception occurred during parsing.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>指定于：</dt>\n<dd><code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueExpressionParser.html#parse(java.lang.String)\">parse</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"../../expression/ValueExpressionParser.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\">ValueExpressionParser</a></code> 中的方法</dd>\n<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>expressionString</code> - 要解析的原始表达式字符串。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>已解析表达式的求值器。</dd>\n<dt>抛出：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/ParseException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\">ParseException</a></code> - 解析过程中发生异常。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>contextAccessor</code> - the factory to create value evaluation context providers, must not be <code>null</code>.</dd>\n<dd><code>valueExpressionParser</code> - the parser to parse expression strings into value expressions, must not be\n         <code>null</code>.</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>contextAccessor</code> - 用于创建值评估上下文提供者的工厂，不能为 <code>null</code>。</dd>\n<dd><code>valueExpressionParser</code> - 用于将表达式字符串解析为值表达式的解析器，不能为 <code>null</code>。</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
